message.entry:
Specify how resource discovery and compute commands reach the final MATLAB node. The template must contain {command} exactly once. Test Connection does not use this template; Probe Resources on the Compute tab uses it to discover the MATLAB root, workers, and pool on the final node.
Direct example: {command}
Jump-host example: ssh node7 -- {command}
Passwordless privilege, jump, and user-switch example: sudo -n -- ssh -o BatchMode=yes gpu6 -- su - yliu7949 -c {command}
